"game_description" = "
Welcome to the LockTrace Game!

Your goal is to discover a hidden combination on a 3x3 grid of 9 dots.

How to Play:

The secret combination is made by connecting any 4 of the 9 dots in a specific order.
To guess the combination, draw a path by selecting 4 dots in sequence.
After completing your path, you'll receive feedback:
Solid white circles: You guessed the correct dot in the correct position.
Hollow white circles: You guessed the correct dot but in the wrong position.
Tips:

The order of the dots matters.
You cannot use the same dot more than once.
You only have 3 attempts!
Good luck!
";

